# 
# Molecular graphics exported from VMD 2.0.0
# http://www.ks.uiuc.edu/Research/vmd/
# 
# Requires Tachyon version 0.99.0 or newer
# 
# Default tachyon rendering command for this scene:
#   tachyon  -aasamples 12 %s -format TARGA -o %s.tga
# 
Begin_Scene
Resolution 900 1100
Shader_Mode Full
  Trans_VMD
  Fog_VMD
  Ambient_Occlusion
    Ambient_Color 0.8 0.8 0.8
    Rescale_Direct 0.3
    Samples 12
End_Shader_Mode
Camera
  Projection Orthographic
  Zoom 0.333333
  Aspectratio 1
  Antialiasing 12
  Raydepth 50
  Center  0 0 -2
  Viewdir -0 -0 2
  Updir   0 1 -0
End_Camera
Directional_Light Direction 0.1 -0.1 1 Color 1 1 1
Directional_Light Direction -1 -2 0.5 Color 1 1 1
Directional_Light Direction 1 -2 -1 Color 1 1 1
Directional_Light Direction 1 1 0 Color 1 1 1

Background 1 1 1
Fog Exp2 Start 0 End 10 Density 0.32 Color 1 1 1
